    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Loghan Ladouceur",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115343585431643372680/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWCRNn6MxTFNbI9TbWZ6jWRZKOnSWEwXiCoG-7Ba9MNfKNF3pg7=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "Amazing boxing gym!\nShoutout to James — he’s really kind and welcoming. They even offer a free one-week trial, which is awesome if you want to try it out with no pressure. There are drinks available at the front, and honestly everyone there is super nice and supportive. Great vibe, great people, and a solid place to train. Highly recommend!",
        "time": 1769186779,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Trinidad R. Tejpal",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114107118404290893063/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWu-lv2yf2lqAbnBA-tQD0fTHqtIyCyRBE7v8LJSk9xXE-k9bEUeg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Fight Club is an incredible boxing gym with a truly welcoming, family-like atmosphere. Java is hands down the best coach—patient, inspirational, and genuinely invested in helping everyone improve, no matter their level.\nI love the supportive environment and the sense of community here. People of all ages are welcome, whether you want to join fun, high-energy group classes or work one-on-one with personal training.\nIf you’re looking for a place that will challenge you, motivate you, and make you feel at home, I highly recommend Fight Club.",
        "time": 1768428437,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "samantha I",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102983567323016486971/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKxXGSsS1sh_Z50xi05Mp-86iIXyrbhPeqNJDedD8gh8UoY0g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I’ve been a member at Fight Club Vaudreuil for over two years now, and it truly feels like a second family. The coaches are amazing! Professional, extremely knowledgeable and genuinely supportive. They take the time to help with technique, and overall progress no matter your level. The kids’ program is also fantastic and really well run. It’s a welcoming, positive environment  and I honestly love everything about this gym. Highly recommend!",
        "time": 1768448426,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Samantha Keys",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105773020327718945967/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKy_IqVZBZ_vo8vAoevViejx7tQGwGXpmoBjQBrm-A6zzu9NA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "I love this place! It has a variety of classes for kids and for adults, very knowledgeable coaches and overall amazing vibe! If you're new to this sport, don't be shy! Everyone is very welcoming and helpful, it's a great atmosphere to either learn something new or refine your skills. I can't recommend this place enough!!",
        "time": 1769020772,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Liliane Tran",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108143534668298821071/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJBsbmFaQytaj40fDUDaam1DHsNlTpXfB_a_sYv2PXpX4y88cE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 weeks ago",
        "text": "Such a great boxing gym. The trainer is patient, encouraging, and really knows how to explain techniques clearly. Every session is intense but fun, and you always leave feeling stronger and more confident. Definitely recommend to anyone wanting to try boxing or level up their training.",
        "time": 1768792649,
        "translated": false
      }
